### 1. Get all orders (no filters - default behavior)
GET {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2. Filter by patient name (NEW)
GET {{baseUrl}}?patientName=John
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Filter by patient name (case-insensitive partial match)
GET {{baseUrl}}?patientName=smith
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Filter by amount range - minimum amount only (NEW)
GET {{baseUrl}}?amountMin=50
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Filter by amount range - maximum amount only (NEW)
GET {{baseUrl}}?amountMax=200
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Filter by amount range - both min and max (NEW)
GET {{baseUrl}}?amountMin=25&amountMax=150
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Filter by status (existing)
GET {{baseUrl}}?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Filter by date from only (existing - updated to range style)
GET {{baseUrl}}?dateFrom=2025-11-20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. Filter by date to only (existing - updated to range style)
GET {{baseUrl}}?dateTo=2025-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. Filter by date range (existing - updated to range style)
GET {{baseUrl}}?dateFrom=2025-11-20&dateTo=2025-11-25
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 11. Filter by order type (existing)
GET {{baseUrl}}?orderType=medicine
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 12. Filter by patient ID (existing)
GET {{baseUrl}}?patientId=64f8a2b4c3d4e5f6789abcde
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 13. Combined filters - All new filters together (NEW)
GET {{baseUrl}}?patientName=John&amountMin=30&amountMax=200
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 14. Complex filter combination (NEW + existing)
GET {{baseUrl}}?patientName=smith&status=confirmed&amountMin=50&amountMax=300&orderType=medicine&dateFrom=2025-11-20&dateTo=2025-11-25
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 15. Filter with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}?patientName=John&page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 16. Filter by amount only with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}?amountMin=100&amountMax=500&page=2&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 17. Filter by date range with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}?dateFrom=2025-11-01&dateTo=2025-11-30&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 18. Maximum filter combination (all parameters)
GET {{baseUrl}}?patientId=64f8a2b4c3d4e5f6789abcde&patientName=John&status=delivered&dateFrom=2025-11-20&dateTo=2025-11-25&orderType=medicine&amountMin=25&amountMax=300&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

